('wikiloc', '83468017', 'https://www.wikiloc.com/hiking-trails/circular-torn-cala-docas-les-rojales-mirador-del-torn-geodesico-del-torn-playa-83468017', 'Torn Circular Route: Cala d''Ocas - Les Rojales - Mirador del Torn - Geodesico del Torn - Beach', '{"en":"Short loop from Cala d''Ocas via GR92","ca":"Circular curta des de Cala d''Ocas pel GR92","es":"Circular corta desde Cala d''Ocas por GR92"}'::jsonb, 'Circular Torn: Cala d''Ocas-les Rojales-Mirador del Torn-Geodesico del Torn-Playa Hiking trail in l''Hospitalet de l''Infant, Catalunya (España). Download its GPS track and follow the itinerary on a map. ruta circular desde Cala d''Ocas, que nos lleva por la montaña del Torn, siguiendo un buen tramo el GR92, hasta el mirador de las Rojales, llegando hasta el geodésico del Torn, y vuelta por la playa.', '{"en":"This easy 6.2 km loop starts from Cala d''Ocas, leading hikers through the Torn mountain area. The route follows a significant section of the GR92 long-distance path, guiding you to the Mirador de les Rojales.\n\nThe trail continues to the Geodesic Vertex of El Torn, offering panoramic views. The return journey completes the loop by descending to the beach, providing a pleasant mix of mountain and coastal scenery suitable for an accessible outing.","ca":"Aquesta ruta circular fàcil de 6.2 km comença des de Cala d''Ocas, portant els excursionistes per la zona de la muntanya del Torn. La ruta segueix un tram important del GR92, guiant-vos fins al Mirador de les Rojales.\n\nEl sender continua fins al Vèrtex Geodèsic del Torn, oferint vistes panoràmiques. El trajecte de tornada completa el circuit baixant a la platja, proporcionant una agradable combinació de paisatges de muntanya i costaners apta per a una sortida accessible.","es":"Esta ruta circular fácil de 6.2 km comienza desde Cala d''Ocas, llevando a los excursionistas por la zona de la montaña del Torn. La ruta sigue un tramo significativo del GR92, guiándote hasta el Mirador de les Rojales.\n\nEl sendero continúa hasta el Vértice Geodésico del Torn, ofreciendo vistas panorámicas. El trayecto de regreso completa el circuito descendiendo a la playa, proporcionando una agradable combinación de paisajes de montaña y costeros apta para una salida accesible."}'::jsonb, 'StoneAge', 6164, 168, 168, 161, 15, 'easy', 'loop', NULL, 9240, 649, '2021-09-09', '2021-08', '[{"lat":40.977256,"lng":0.902354,"ele":-13.8},{"lat":40.977257,"lng":0.902354,"ele":-13.8},{"lat":40.977242,"lng":0.902352,"ele":-13.8},{"lat":40.977233,"lng":0.902346,"ele":-13.8},{"lat":40.977265,"lng":0.902372,"ele":-15.3},{"lat":40.977265,"lng":0.902354,"ele":-12.4},{"lat":40.97725,"lng":0.90231,"ele":-10},{"lat":40.977243,"lng":0.902273,"ele":-8.1},{"lat":40.97725,"lng":0.902241,"ele":-6.6},{"lat":40.977167,"lng":0.902003,"ele":-5.2},{"lat":40.977119,"lng":0.901871,"ele":-3.8},{"lat":40.977085,"lng":0.901635,"ele":-0.4},{"lat":40.977093,"lng":0.901601,"ele":0.1},{"lat":40.977103,"lng":0.901505,"ele":2},{"lat":40.977115,"lng":0.901459,"ele":3.5},{"lat":40.977172,"lng":0.901271,"ele":5.4},{"lat":40.977167,"lng":0.901249,"ele":5.4},{"lat":40.977231,"lng":0.900993,"ele":8.3},{"lat":40.977239,"lng":0.900775,"ele":11.6},{"lat":40.977293,"lng":0.900586,"ele":13.1},{"lat":40.977306,"lng":0.900546,"ele":13.6},{"lat":40.977362,"lng":0.900359,"ele":14},{"lat":40.977442,"lng":0.900125,"ele":14.5},{"lat":40.977452,"lng":0.900092,"ele":15},{"lat":40.977476,"lng":0.899974,"ele":15},{"lat":40.977525,"lng":0.899819,"ele":16},{"lat":40.977533,"lng":0.899791,"ele":16},{"lat":40.977596,"lng":0.89953,"ele":16.9},{"lat":40.97767,"lng":0.899282,"ele":17.9},{"lat":40.977773,"lng":0.898999,"ele":18.8},{"lat":40.977886,"lng":0.898865,"ele":19.8},{"lat":40.977952,"lng":0.898709,"ele":20.3},{"lat":40.97805,"lng":0.898473,"ele":21.2},{"lat":40.978086,"lng":0.89839,"ele":21.2},{"lat":40.977969,"lng":0.898269,"ele":21.2},{"lat":40.977798,"lng":0.898207,"ele":21.7},{"lat":40.977692,"lng":0.898052,"ele":22.7},{"lat":40.977694,"lng":0.898