Velocidad media: 2.37 km/hVel. en Mov.: 5.15 km/h', '{"en":"This challenging loop in the l''Obac area summits Castellsapera, La Mamella, Punta dels Caus Cremats, Puig Codina, and Roca del Corb. The route covers 12.3 km with 542m of elevation gain.\n\nThe ascent to Castellsapera is particularly demanding and involves sections with significant exposure and a degree of danger. Similarly, the path to Roca del Corb includes delicate points and narrow sections near cliffs.\n\nThis route is suitable for experienced hikers comfortable with exposed terrain and requiring careful footing. It offers a robust mountain experience through forests and trails, visiting various fountains along the way.","ca":"Aquesta ruta circular exigent a la zona de l''Obac ascendeix a Castellsapera, La Mamella, Punta dels Caus Cremats, Puig Codina i Roca del Corb. El recorregut té 12.3 km amb 542m de desnivell positiu.\n\nL''ascens a Castellsapera és particularment exigent i implica trams amb exposició significativa i un cert grau de perill. De manera similar, el camí cap a la Roca del Corb inclou punts delicats i seccions estretes prop de cingles.\n\nAquesta ruta és adequada per a excursionistes experimentats que se sentin còmodes amb terrenys exposats i que requereixin una trepitjada acurada. Ofereix una experiència de muntanya robusta a través de boscos i senders, visitant diverses fonts al llarg del camí.","es":"Esta ruta circular exigente en la zona de l''Obac asciende a Castellsapera, La Mamella, Punta dels Caus Cremats, Puig Codina y Roca del Corb. El recorrido tiene 12.3 km con 542m de desnivel positivo.\n\nEl ascenso a Castellsapera es particularmente exigente e implica tramos con exposición significativa y un cierto grado de peligro. De manera similar, el camino hacia la Roca del Corb incluye puntos delicados y secciones estrechas cerca de acantilados.\n\nEsta ruta es adecuada para excursionistas experimentados que se sientan cómodos con terrenos expuestos y que requieran una pisada cuidadosa. Ofrece una experiencia de montaña robusta a través de bosques y senderos, visitando varias fuentes a lo largo del camino."}'::jsonb, 'chatame1', 12263, 542, 542, 956, 614, 'difficult', 'loop', NULL, 19140, 1309, '2021-12-11', '2021-11', '[{"lat":41.640725,"lng":1.991492,"ele":616.1},{"lat":41.640682,"lng":1.991469,"ele":615.5},{"lat":41.640592,"lng":1.991531,"ele":615.5},{"lat":41.640312,"lng":1.991847,"ele":614.4},{"lat":41.640275,"lng":1.991892,"ele":614.3},{"lat":41.640189,"lng":1.991982,"ele":614.4},{"lat":41.64012,"lng":1.992049,"ele":614.2},{"lat":41.640076,"lng":1.991994,"ele":614.2},{"lat":41.640074,"lng":1.991951,"ele":614},{"lat":41.640084,"lng":1.991907,"ele":615.3},{"lat":41.640541,"lng":1.991377,"ele":621.7},{"lat":41.640761,"lng":1.991166,"ele":624},{"lat":41.640834,"lng":1.991073,"ele":625.1},{"lat":41.640847,"lng":1.991012,"ele":625.4},{"lat":41.640851,"lng":1.99096,"ele":625.9},{"lat":41.640822,"lng":1.990901,"ele":626.4},{"lat":41.640769,"lng":1.990878,"ele":627},{"lat":41.640717,"lng":1.990877,"ele":627.3},{"lat":41.640667,"lng":1.990864,"ele":628.1},{"lat":41.64062,"lng":1.990843,"ele":628.9},{"lat":41.640577,"lng":1.990809,"ele":629.8},{"lat":41.640561,"lng":1.990746,"ele":630.5},{"lat":41.640553,"lng":1.990681,"ele":630.7},{"lat":41.640598,"lng":1.990621,"ele":630.7},{"lat":41.640709,"lng":1.990502,"ele":631.2},{"lat":41.640746,"lng":1.990443,"ele":631.1},{"lat":41.640755,"lng":1.990356,"ele":631.1},{"lat":41.640817,"lng":1.990312,"ele":631.6},{"lat":41.64079,"lng":1.990126,"ele":631.6},{"lat":41.640854,"lng":1.990298,"ele":631.6},{"lat":41.640897,"lng":1.990262,"ele":632.6},{"lat":41.6409,"lng":1.990197,"ele":633.3},{"lat":41.640884,"lng":1.990127,"ele":634.2},{"lat":41.640774,"lng":1.98989,"ele":637.2},{"lat":41.640753,"lng":1.989782,"ele":638},{"lat":41.640781,"lng":1.989763,"ele":638},{"lat":41.640797,"lng":1.98971,"ele":638.5},{"lat":41.640835,"lng":1.989662,"ele":639.4},{"lat":41.640867,"lng":1.98961,"ele":640.1},{"lat":41.640887,"