('wikiloc', '91008004', 'https://www.wikiloc.com/hiking-trails/la-coscollosa-100-cims-feec-ibp-63-hkg-17-12-2021-91008004', 'La Coscollosa ~ La Moleta [2x100 Peaks FEEC] - Coll de l''Avenquet - Font Nova Leisure Area/Refuge - [IBP63HKG] - [17.12.2021]', '{"en":"Short loop from Font Nova refuge","ca":"Circular curta des del refugi Font Nova","es":"Circular corta desde el refugio Font Nova"}'::jsonb, 'La Coscollosa ~ La Moleta [2x100 Cims FEEC] -Coll de l''Avenquet-Àrea de Lleure/Refugi de la Font Nova-[IBP63HKG]-[17.12.2021] Hiking trail in Paüls, Catalunya (España). Download its GPS track and follow the itinerary on a map. RUTA GRABADA CON GARMIN ETREX 30X Y VERIFICADA CON BASECAMP :  
 
