Òrrius: https://es.wikiloc.com/rutas-senderismo/orrius-laberints-turo-rodo-turo-de-cellecs-turo-de-mataro-dolmen-de-cellecs-bosc-encantat-sant-bart-93385240', '{"en":"This moderate 16.5 km loop with 523m of elevation gain starts from Mataró, offering a journey through the municipality''s most notable landscapes. The route is physically and technically moderate, requiring attention to GPS navigation as it is not signposted.\n\nHighlights include the Cinc Sénies area, Torre d''Onofre Arnau, and the Turó d''Onofre Arnau summit. The trail also visits the churches of Sant Miquel de Mata and Sant Martí de Mata, along with several natural springs like Font dels Avellaners, Font de la Moreneta, and Font de n''Homs, providing a comprehensive exploration of the area.","ca":"Aquesta ruta circular moderada de 16,5 km amb 523m de desnivell positiu comença a Mataró, oferint un recorregut pels paisatges més destacats del municipi. La ruta és moderada tant físicament com tècnicament, i requereix atenció a la navegació GPS ja que no està senyalitzada.\n\nEls punts clau inclouen la zona de les Cinc Sénies, la Torre d''Onofre Arnau i el cim del Turó d''Onofre Arnau. El camí també visita les esglésies de Sant Miquel de Mata i Sant Martí de Mata, juntament amb diverses fonts naturals com la Font dels Avellaners, la Font de la Moreneta i la Font de n''Homs, proporcionant una exploració completa de la zona.","es":"Esta ruta circular moderada de 16,5 km con 523m de desnivel positivo comienza en Mataró, ofreciendo un recorrido por los paisajes más destacados del municipio. La ruta es moderada tanto física como técnicamente, y requiere atención a la navegación GPS ya que no está señalizada.\n\nLos puntos clave incluyen la zona de Les Cinc Sénies, la Torre d''Onofre Arnau y la cima del Turó d''Onofre Arnau. El sendero también visita las iglesias de Sant Miquel de Mata y Sant Martí de Mata, junto con varias fuentes naturales como la Font dels Avellaners, la Font de la Moreneta y la Font de n''Homs, proporcionando una exploración completa de la zona."}'::jsonb, 'Tetititu', 16464, 523, 523, 393, 32, 'moderate', 'loop', NULL, 21840, 2204, '2022-01-29', '2021-12', '[{"lat":41.546129,"lng":2.454223,"ele":50.1},{"lat":41.546128,"lng":2.454221,"ele":50.6},{"lat":41.546144,"lng":2.454222,"ele":49.1},{"lat":41.546144,"lng":2.454223,"ele":50.6},{"lat":41.546146,"lng":2.454224,"ele":49.1},{"lat":41.546148,"lng":2.454242,"ele":49.1},{"lat":41.546166,"lng":2.454363,"ele":48.6},{"lat":41.546184,"lng":2.454389,"ele":48.6},{"lat":41.546249,"lng":2.454501,"ele":48.6},{"lat":41.546249,"lng":2.454524,"ele":49.6},{"lat":41.546361,"lng":2.454792,"ele":50.1},{"lat":41.54645,"lng":2.454984,"ele":50.1},{"lat":41.546455,"lng":2.454997,"ele":50.1},{"lat":41.546534,"lng":2.45514,"ele":50.6},{"lat":41.54659,"lng":2.455266,"ele":51},{"lat":41.546596,"lng":2.455285,"ele":51},{"lat":41.546603,"lng":2.455307,"ele":51},{"lat":41.546612,"lng":2.455326,"ele":51},{"lat":41.54663,"lng":2.455351,"ele":51},{"lat":41.54664,"lng":2.455367,"ele":51},{"lat":41.54665,"lng":2.455385,"ele":51.5},{"lat":41.54666,"lng":2.4554,"ele":51},{"lat":41.546672,"lng":2.455411,"ele":51},{"lat":41.546683,"lng":2.455417,"ele":51},{"lat":41.546729,"lng":2.455462,"ele":51.5},{"lat":41.546744,"lng":2.455476,"ele":51.5},{"lat":41.546759,"lng":2.455494,"ele":51.5},{"lat":41.546772,"lng":2.455512,"ele":51.5},{"lat":41.546788,"lng":2.455526,"ele":51.5},{"lat":41.546809,"lng":2.455544,"ele":52},{"lat":41.546818,"lng":2.455558,"ele":52},{"lat":41.546904,"lng":2.455695,"ele":53.4},{"lat":41.547022,"lng":2.455843,"ele":53.4},{"lat":41.547033,"lng":2.455873,"ele":53.4},{"lat":41.547034,"lng":2.45592,"ele":53.4},{"lat":41.547061,"lng":2.455952,"ele":53.4},{"lat":41.547074,"lng":2.455974,"ele":53.4},{"lat":41.547164,"lng":2.456079,"ele":53.9},{"lat":41.547254,"lng":2.456175,"ele":53.9},{"lat":41.547348,"lng":2.456292,"ele":54.9},{"lat":41.547444,"lng":2.456427,"ele":55.4},{"lat":41.547525,"lng":2.45656,"ele":55.4},{"lat":41.54